WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.322 --> 00:00:02.041
- [Announcer] Take your
fitness to the next level,

00:00:02.041 --> 00:00:03.655
with the tuenfit 4s.

00:00:03.655 --> 00:00:04.804
The pulse tracking wrist band

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:08.554
that gets you in shape,
on and off the field.

00:00:09.796 --> 00:00:12.629
tunefit 4s measures
distance traveled, steps,

00:00:12.629 --> 00:00:15.160
and floors climbed, all at
the flick of your wrist.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:17.227
So you can chart your progress all day

00:00:17.227 --> 00:00:20.466
with a variety of useful steps.

00:00:20.466 --> 00:00:23.229
tunefit 4s automatically
monitors your sleep

00:00:23.229 --> 00:00:25.957
to show you how well you've
slept and for how long.

00:00:25.957 --> 00:00:28.888
And if you're sleeping with anybody.

00:00:28.888 --> 00:00:30.717
How's that going?

00:00:30.717 --> 00:00:33.457
Use social mode to connect
with out tunefit community.

00:00:33.457 --> 00:00:35.942
Look how in shape and attractive they are.

00:00:35.942 --> 00:00:37.950
And now you can share your workout results

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.200
with the rest of the world.

00:00:42.548 --> 00:00:43.546
Feeling stressed?

00:00:43.546 --> 00:00:45.160
Breath tracker analyzes and corrects

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.121
your breathing patterns,
pulse, and sexual frustrations.

00:00:48.121 --> 00:00:50.060
- [Device] Breathe now, breathe now.

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:50.930
- [Announcer] You'll also stay motivated

00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:52.881
with tuner penalty,
which keeps you in check

00:00:52.881 --> 00:00:56.004
if you fail to meet your goals.

00:00:56.004 --> 00:00:57.504
- Um, can I get a?

00:00:58.361 --> 00:01:00.381
- [Announcer] If you miss
runs, consume bad calories,

00:01:00.381 --> 00:01:04.851
or continue being single,
you'll lose points.

00:01:04.851 --> 00:01:07.045
Because unhealthy eating
and lifestyle decisions

00:01:07.045 --> 00:01:09.727
not only kill you, they
keep you alone forever.

00:01:09.727 --> 00:01:11.468
(device beeps)

00:01:11.468 --> 00:01:13.094
We believe the path to a better life,

00:01:13.094 --> 00:01:15.242
