00:01:15.242 --> 00:01:17.680
And it's really not
that hard at all, Kate.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:19.073
Stop running from your problems,

00:01:19.073 --> 00:01:23.067
And start running toward
your solutions, Kate.

00:01:23.067 --> 00:01:25.563
Make every breath count,
because breath is limited

00:01:25.563 --> 00:01:27.699
