00:01:27.699 --> 00:01:29.905
And you don't want to die alone, right?

00:01:29.905 --> 00:01:30.985
Are you still single?

00:01:30.985 --> 00:01:32.633
What happened to all of your goals?

00:01:32.633 --> 00:01:33.876
How's your dating going, Kate?

00:01:33.876 --> 00:01:34.712
